v 3
d Cox PH model with gamma frailty using the E-M method
d stcoxem fits a Cox proportional hazards model with gamma-distributed frailty using the Expectation-Maximization method.
d The E-M method provides significant speed benefit over the Stata built-in stcox command, but preserves accuracy.
d 
d Program by Barna Szabó-Söderberg
d Distribution-Date: 2026.10.10
